    <briefdescription>
<para>public </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>An atom of Tarantool storage. Represents MsgPack Array. Tuple has the following structure: uint32 uint32 bsize +----------------<mdash/>+----------<mdash/>+ tuple_begin, ..., raw = | offN | ... | off1 | MessagePack | | +----------------<mdash/>+----------<mdash/>+ | ^ +------------------------------------<mdash/>data_offset</para><para>Each &apos;off_i&apos; is the offset to the i-th indexed field. </para>    </detaileddescription>
